            "text": "theorem E_on_patch (F : Profile) (XR eta x : ℝ) (hXR : 0 < XR)\n    (hx : x ∈ Icc compensationPatch.left compensationPatch.right) :\n    E F XR (patchRadius F XR * x, eta) =\n      shapedPatchAmplitude F eta * x ^ (-(1 / 2 + F.data.core.lam))"
